  "elevationPhilosophy": "Mailchimp uses elevation sparingly and only through warm-tinted shadows: rgba(35,30,21,0.15) — the same hue as the brand's near-black. This means floating elements feel ink-stained rather than digitally lifted. The rare use of shadow (only on the pricing widget and floating cards) makes those elements read as physical objects on the page. All other layering is achieved through surface color changes (white → gray → parchment → dark) rather than z-axis illusion.",
